      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5ecb54c50739a41ff0269047|full_name}: We haven't deprecated any features from 2017 through 2018 to 2019? I'm confused, can you cite specifics? I might be able to help you.\nI will note that we cannot (and will not) support old versions of assets forever-- there will come a point at which content may break due to Unity engine upgrades. We cannot guarantee that content will persist perfectly over time.\n2017, in particular, was the first release that supported the Oculus Quest. As such, many changes and improvements have occured over time to both VRChat and the Unity engine.\nIn particular, this issue (shaders breaking) is definitely a Unity bug, and potentially one we can't work around.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
