      "value": "@{5ecb54c50739a41ff0269047|full_name}: If you're talking about SDK2 Triggers and Actions, they still work perfectly fine in 2019. It has not had any features intentionally disabled.\nI will note that SDK2 is deprecated, which means that it won't get any new feature upgrades and is lower priority for bugfixes. It isn't disabled, and you can still build content with it, although we recommend against doing so, as it may eventually stop working one day. Such is the nature of rolling releases!",
